le relying), logic 5 (A3 enacts B2; A5 uses B4's apology), relationship 4 (B wants cups and milk), heightening 4 (A5 seeks exact compliance), specificity 5 (breakfast objects connect A1–B4), brevity/wit 4 (A5's conscientious denial earns the turn); total 92. Hard gates pass.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"The final appliance problem is newly introduced by B4, but it continues the same breakfast task and governing reasoning.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S155-single-b\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"8dddb84bb9b7a3fd8c8e2bb4bb45739a6ad3400ad3459907c24a6532f7953c3a\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A5 calls printing coincidence, but A1 only reports the formula and A3 never audibly follows B2's lullaby advice.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"B2 specifies lullabies, yet A3 discusses recording; B4's success therefore requires an unspoken intervention.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 2, \"evidence\": \"B2 supplies a fact and B4 reports output without a separate workplace want or constraint.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A5 records the result but does not clearly increase reliance beyond A3's troubleshooting intention.\"},\n          \"specificity\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A1 establishes a jammed printer, though A5's C major has no prior musical support.\"},\n          \"brevityWit\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A5's musical coincidence is neat wording, but its key and the missing song make the wit partly unearned.\"}\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 59\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Your formula says sing to the jammed printer. Payroll needs these now.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"text\": \"It likes lullabies. Start softly.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"A\", \"text\": \"Sleep, little printer, the stapler is near.\"},\n        {\"speaker\": \"B\", \"te